{"sba-sakura-39731":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは　\nまもなく３日間の『BACKS LIVE !!』がスタートしますhttps://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/page/backslive　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG21Q50RHQH8JXEFHK7RAF6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　サイリウムカラーはサクラピンク × パステルブルーです　　久しぶりに皆さんにお会いできるのが凄く楽しみですこの日までの過程を全て結果に出せるように頑張ります　　配信を見てくださる皆さんもサイリウムなどを振って楽しんでいただけたら嬉しいです😃🤍　それでは、また後程お会いしましょう　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG21R7H679G7M98KZR9JFPA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n             "}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20783":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校帰りに\nみーぱんに呼ばれて\n会いにいったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかの\n誕生日プレゼントをもらって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0Y9SHSJ54BVVTN52CAA53","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしすぎて\n楽しすぎて\nもらったクッキー\nその場で全部食べちゃいました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我慢できないのは\nとってもよくない私のクセです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YC896S4B4H71EJSPR3PN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんの冷蔵庫にあった\nわらび餅をもらって\nホットケーキも食べて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーぱんのお菓子箱が\nいっぱい入ってて\nテンション上がって\nいろいろ食べすぎちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわくなって体重計に乗ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、な、なんと\n3キロも増加していました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YEB7QETHAYHRA3VT8852","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こここここれはやばい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今からダイエット再開。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YG8BQNAVYXSE51JF49S0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっそく帰って\n半身浴してお部屋の掃除して\n寝ることにしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YK3JYH7TP84Y7BJP7HZV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みれいちゃん\n誕生日プレゼントと\n楽しい時間をありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにみれいちゃんと会って\nキャーキャー騒いで若返りました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YNQWMAB4CGVR1SGZ32TJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は『EX大衆』さんの発売日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のインタビューが載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての1人の取材でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とーっても楽しい取材でいっぱい話しちゃいました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりわたしは喋ることが大好きだー(*ﾟ∀ﾟ*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでも私が楽しく喋ることができたのはインタビュアーさんのおかげなんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学でインタビューの授業をとっていて\nインタビューの大変さを身に染みていたのでインタビュアーさんすごい！って思ってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビュー対象者＝私についての下調べを抜かりなくしてあって一つの質問に対して私が答えたところからさらに掘り下げてくれてまた新しい質問をしてくれました♡\n私に興味を持ってインタビューしてくれているんだなって感じられてもうすごくすごく嬉しくなってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※太字は今私が授業で苦戦している点→他人に興味が持てず、なかなか質問をつなげられないため。※"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はひっそりインタビュアーさんを尊敬の眼差しで見ていたのでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YRV0PR7V9RR886VM664J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YWQ4N4T1NJAGBE04T8HF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットの自撮りをしようと思ったらカメラマンさんが私の携帯で撮ってくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもとても親切にしていただきました！光栄でしたヽ(；▽；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG0YZ1CFHDYHPSZ0EKPW4W7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェキもあるのでぜひぜひお手にとってみてください♡♡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-5757":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて、昨日は七夕でしたね！\n織姫と彦星さんが会えるめでたい日でしたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほぼ、四年に一度しか晴れないと言われてるのですが、昼前かな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨降ってなかったねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めでたいめでたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんはなにかお願い事はしたかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもお願い事したよ！\n大好きな皆さん........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで、かなうよー！\n全国握手会！ありましたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方〜どうでしたかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかてか！昨日はものすごい人の数でしたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビックリです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の曲を披露させていただきましたが..............."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも支えてくださる、大事なファンの皆様に、ありがとうの気持ちを込めて、\nサプライズということで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月22日発売の新曲！\n走れBicycle\nを歌わせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーでしたかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくいい曲でしょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏らしくて、衣装もキラキラで可愛くて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかった方は......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またのきかいをお待ちしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く会いに来てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はいい経験でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の人と握手することで、\n沢山のことが勉強出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方から！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★全握は、推しじゃなくても、握手することで、そのひとのよさを知れた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★毎回blog見てるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★いつもパワーもらってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか！いってくださって、沢山のパワーを皆様からもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやももっともっとパワーをあたえれるような、ありがとーって感謝されるような、そんな素敵な人になりたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の恩返しをしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてねぇ、リハーサル中にねぇ、\nななせまるがねぇー\n『何番、和田、まあや、』\nって言ってきて、\n『なに？笑』\nって聞いたら\n『なんか野球の放送のまね！笑』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとかいってニヤニヤしながら言ってきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにかわいーぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんのしぐさはほんとに女の子らしくて、女の子でもドキドキしちゃうくらい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへっ！\nこれからもよろしくっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/08/2635039/0001.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}}